    "notes": "SHN's created by Greg Hurwitt, phobos@quik.com.  Notes on SHN creation:\nI started with seed discs kindly supplied by Stu Hanson from the BUDD mailing list.  Discs were ripped using EAC V0.9pb11 two times and checksums compared to insure perfect rip.  (Errors were encountered on track 1 at 1:33 and 3:27 on both passes, however, I can detect no audible problems at these locations.)\n\nThe following edits were then made using Cool Edit 2000:\n  - removed clicks at t1 2:12, t1 4:01, and t9 4:23\n  - removed clicks at previous track boundaries\nTracks were split using CD Wave V1.62, and sector boundaries verified using shntool V1.01.  SHN's were created (with seek information embedded) using mkwACT V0.97b1.\n\nThe show was treed via the JFT and GDH-Trading mailing lists in October 2001.  This info file is available at: http://houston.quik.com/phobos/ja67-08-04_info.txt\n\nThe following flaw is present on this seed:\n  - t11 0:35, digi-static",
    "backup_location": "ia903601_29",
